{"parse": {"title": "RUG-10", "pageid": 23029, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-09\" title=\"RUG-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RUG-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-11\" title=\"RUG-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RUG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.87.E5.AE.B6.E5.AE.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"过家家\">过家家</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 过家家</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Let's Play House</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>枚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>口<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>饼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>干<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>满<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>样<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>半<span class=\"color-value\"></span>分<span class=\"color-value\"></span>给<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>半<span class=\"color-value\"></span>留<span class=\"color-value\"></span>给<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1510110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都比想象中进展得更加好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>过去的两周之中，经由拉普拉斯转递，向基金会申请活动举办资格的进程顺利。宽檐帽先生今早与我通过电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们认为，这是一个树立神秘学家正面形象的好机会，更可以推进人类与神秘学家的交流、关联。基金会总乐于看到这一幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>审批文件的下放时间呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>因为流程复杂，以及近日才完成的比赛项目安全性申报，审批至少需要20天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>20天？如果20天后才能确认开工，我们就赶不上预定的举办日期了——之前，施工队说至少需要一个半月来完成入口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这已经是很快的速度了，我们的时间还能再推迟吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嗯……恐怕不行。我已经为修缮推迟了半个月，如果继续推迟，夏天就要结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>没关系，我与他们规划过施工顺序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张标记着许多文字的地图在桌面上铺开。爱兹拉手持红笔，划出一道新的弧线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我们可以优先开始修缮工作，而后调派人手，同时进行多类工作。如同图示，优化分工和时间安排，赶在一个月内完成修缮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>届时，刚好可以赶上可燃点小姐最初安排的日期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>天啊——我明明都看了好多次日程安排了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你是怎么做到挤出半个月时间来的！真是不可思议——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点拿起纸页，举到面前认真观看起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你可真是个天才，爱兹拉！没有你，我们的比赛或许就办不成了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>这在人类之中并没有什么了不起的，神秘学家才该是这场比赛的主心骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>让我看看——将工人小队分为三组，分别开始修缮运动场内部吊顶、墙壁与外部入口……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……运动场内部的吊顶与墙壁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>爱兹拉，我没有与拉普拉斯维修队提出过这样的需求，你们一定是搞错了什么，我们不需要对运动场内部进行更迭！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>这是我增加的维修项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我已经带着维修队的成员去考察过，那里十分古老，墙壁风化严重，支撑结构薄弱。比起运动场，更像是自然景观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>为了观众和运动员们的安全考量，我们选用合金支架进行支撑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不行！绝对不行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>椅子向后翻倒，可燃点猛地站起身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>那可是乌卢鲁运动场啊，那不是可以随便搭建的办公楼！我是不会让你们进去的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果你早一步告诉我，你会做出这种事情——我就不会让那儿的门开着了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>可是观众们要怎么办？可燃点小姐，观众的安全呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>如果遭遇塌方或是落石，那些观众应该如何逃生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>过去从没有发生过这样的事，这么多年来都没有！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>世界上从来都没有万全不变的事物，我们必须预估可能发生的危险，才好避免悲剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……人们能躲开的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你们不是也研究出来了吗？乌卢鲁运动场会祛除神秘学家身上的疲劳，将其身体与神秘学能力调整到最佳状态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>当“万一”的危险来临，他们能保护自己，那些预言家与占卜师也能保护他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我们从来都不需要钢铁架子来保护我们的脑袋！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>那人类的观众呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>他们没有神奇能力，也没有超强感知，无法驾驶扫帚，也无法瞬间移动，他们甚至无法从密集的人群中尽可能快地抽身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>在你预想中，人类观众要如何保证自己的安全呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>人类？人类为什么会在运动场里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>乌卢鲁运动会从没有人类参加过，没有人类寻着它的大门，无人成功踏入其中——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……可我也是一个人类，可燃点小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>你邀请过我，你说过“乌卢鲁运动场”出现在了我面前，人类——也就是我，从那一刻开始，就可以踏入这所运动场了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉手里的水杯落在桌面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你——我，我当时以为你是不一样的人类！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你很关心神秘学家，你愿意帮忙，心地也不坏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我并不是人类中特殊的个体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我并不比其他人类更崇高与伟大，我不值得获得殊荣，我与大多数人类一样——我只是一个普通的人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>既然我被乌卢鲁运动场接受，那其他人类自然可以踏足其中！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉的手掌按在红笔勾勒的计划地图上，巨大的弧线无声地向他划去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>可燃点，爱兹拉，你们先冷静一下——！现在不是吵架的时候！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>现在不是吵架的时候，什么时候是吵架的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>世界上尽是人类的运动会，一个又一个、一个又一个的人类运动会！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>但世界上只有这么一个神秘学家的运动会呀！你们去管理自己的运动会还不够吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>人类把神秘术抢走了，加上科学，加上那些我听不懂的东西，那些我知道的戏法就变成了新东西——属于人类的新东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>现在他们又要用合成金属架子来抢夺乌卢鲁运动场了——那是我找到的运动场，我是不会把它让给你们的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不甘示弱的姑娘一样伸手，将桌面上的地图拉向自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>抢夺……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我们，不……我，我从没有想过要抢夺任何东西，可燃点小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我只是想为你提供帮助，拉普拉斯的大多数研究员也一样，我们生活在实验室中，我们读书，我们彻夜不眠——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我们从来都不是为了人类的崇高，也不是为了神秘学家的名誉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>那些结果——那些，神秘学与科学的结晶，它们的诞生是为了创造便利，为所有人创造便利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一股力道，充满着憋闷和不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>便利？什么便利！别以为我没看过拉普拉斯科算中心的广告！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>以科学引导神秘学，以理智驾驭无序的力量——这不都是你们对外说的话吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一股力道，满是不甘和委屈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点将身体越过桌面，愤怒让她的脸颊发红、滚烫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……理智将引导感情，好让它不至于覆灭于自身燃起的烈火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>你需要悉心地对待火焰，了解它们，保护它们远离危险……这是我所受到的教育，也是我一直以来践行的原则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>现在，我们所处的手提箱也正放置于人类与人类用手掌搭建出的入口！你正立于其上，你不该如此揣测他们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理智的漂亮孩子眉间紧皱，握着钢笔的手指用力得发白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我们想提供帮助，仅此而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>平整的桌面上，修缮计划图纸被扯成了两半，如同一条难以弥合的裂谷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我回去了！我和这种无礼的家伙没有任何好谈的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点快步离去，她的脚步越来越快，越来越快，直至几近奔跑，最终砰地一声，将自己关入了走廊尽头的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>对不起，我也先回去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深深地低下头，另一个孩子逃也似的离开了桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_ditu1\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_ditu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是一张很好的地图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伸出双手，左右拼合，纸张上巨大的裂痕依旧难以忽视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它不应该就这样碎掉……不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我不喜欢半途而废，也没有搞砸过任何工作——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_ditu2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_ditu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_ditu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙丝绒按住地图左侧的一半，将右侧推往燃烧的火焰面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我负责这个，你……负责这个？怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>和平乌鲁？你还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>没关系，我只是……感觉有些恍惚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>从上次和那些本耶普战斗后，我总觉得脑子有些昏沉，有时还会感到身体痒痒的……我想这可能是因为我还没有完全恢复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和平乌鲁摇着头，拾起残破的纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>这半张地图就交给我吧，我会和她好好谈谈的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>辛苦你了，和平乌鲁。我会再和拉普拉斯询问是否可以增加你的助燃剂剂量的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>沙丝绒负责那一侧，我也会继续推动基金会方面的许可证书事宜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>行动起来吧，朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>桌边的人一个接一个离去，最终只剩下几只零落的座椅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">本耶普：</div><div>……嘶嘶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一抹煤渣般的小小的黑色由一处阴影中走出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着跃入另一处阴影，消失无踪了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报社主编：</div><div>你说的是什么话！什么叫没有新消息了？！<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报社主编：</div><div>乌卢鲁运动场修缮进度——谁会为了这个买你们的报纸？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两撇八字胡在愤怒的鼻息下瑟瑟发抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>……对不起，主编。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>我们已经很久没有得到复兴小队的信息。在上次报道风波后，他们已经有两周左右没有离开过那个箱子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>我们放出的信子也还没有音讯……呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>成沓稿纸摔打在马科尔阴沉的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报社主编：</div><div>我接收你这种声名狼藉的家伙在新闻界，可不是为了拿到这么无聊的消息的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-501702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报社主编：</div><div>去！再给我去找——找到像是“乌卢鲁运动会复兴小队与兔女郎大闹市政厅”一样，有趣儿、有味道又爆炸的东西来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵河马般的咆哮后，主编摔门而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-613801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">本耶普：</div><div>嘶嘶——嘶……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>……呵，真巧，是你回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身形小巧的本耶普蛇一般地爬上马科尔的身体，盘踞在他的手指上。几秒之后，便化作了一团墨渍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>乌卢鲁运动会濒临破裂，复兴小队……内讧，不和！我就知道，你们如此愚笨，一定会自取灭亡——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>多有趣的消息啊……主编和她都一定会满意的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-615015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-615015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/HeadIconSmall-615015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马科尔：</div><div>呵呵，呵呵呵呵呵……咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马科尔的身影在阴影中抖动，抖动，抖动，直到剧烈地摆动起来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RUG-10"}}